  "reasoning": "The facts describe three distinct criminal conduct by the public official Huang: (1) He used his position to obtain cash, shopping cards and gold from companies and individuals, which constitutes the crime of accepting bribes (受贿罪). (2) He diverted public funds from the state‑owned housing construction company to a private individual without proper approval, which is the crime of embezzling public funds (挪用公款罪). (3) His personal assets far exceed his lawful income and a large portion cannot be explained, fitting the offense of receiving unexplained huge property (收受巨额财产罪). Therefore the appropriate charges are the three crimes listed.",
